- * Free hooks that have no alloc hook counterpart, and thus safe to call:
+ * Free hooks that have no alloc hook counterpart, and thus safe to call
+ * when spinning is allowed:
  * - debug_check_no_locks_freed()
  * - debug_check_no_obj_freed()
  * - __kcsan_check_access()
  */
